 & = \omega \ d(v_{k},P)^2 + (1-\omega) \ d(y_k,P)^2 + \frac{\gamma^2 }{\eta} \left\{d(y_k,P)^2 - \E \left[ d(x_{k+1},P)^2 \right]\right\} \nonumber \\
